# Web3Forms access key for the contact form.
#
#   1. Go to https://web3forms.com
#   2. Enter the email you want messages delivered to
#   3. They email you an access key — paste it below
#
# Then copy this file to .env.local (which git ignores) and fill it in.
# The key is safe to expose in client code; that is how Web3Forms is designed.
#
# Without it the form renders but is disabled, and the mailto link still works.
VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
